These form an orthogonal set, so
          <me>
            \hat x = \left(\frac{b\cdot u_1}{u_1\cdot u_1},\;
              \frac{b\cdot u_2}{u_2\cdot u_2},\;
              \frac{b\cdot u_3}{u_3\cdot u_3}
              \right)
            = \left(\frac{-3}{2},\;\frac{-3}{2},\;\frac{8}{4}\right)
            = \left(-\frac32,\;-\frac32,\;2\right).
          </me>

