We solved this least-squares problem in this <xref ref="leastsquares-eg-bestfit-line-a"/>: the only least-squares solution to <m>Ax=b</m> is <m>\hat x = {M\choose B} = {-3\choose 5}</m>, so the best-fit line is
        <me>y = -3x + 5.</me>
